  "bodyHash": "Z5qWdzoPx8U=",
  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Gobber/BH_NU_HEADER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1665\" height=\"420\"></strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;强大的护甲、工具、武器、戒指、护符和法杖。</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Gobber/BH_NU_BANNER1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"142\"></strong></p><p>Gobber模组旨在通过提供增强的护甲、工具和武器，让Minecraft的游玩体验更加充实。此外，该模组还提供特殊物品（戒指、法杖和护符），带来各种生活品质提升和便利功能。有些人可能认为这些物品过于强大，但在我看来，这取决于个人选择。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fclients%252faff.php%253faff%253d3271\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Gobber/BH_NU_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"190\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Gobber/BH_NU_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"142\"></p><p>- 在主世界、下界和末地新增（3）种矿石，主世界还有深板岩版本</p><p>- 世界生成中会出现Gobber幸运方块，内含多种实用掉落物<br>- （3）套远超钻石级别的武器和工具</p><p>- （3）套多功能工具、锤子、挖掘铲、伐木斧和自定义弓<br>- （4）套护甲提供特殊能力，如自动进食/饱食、水下呼吸、防火、免疫跌落伤害等。末影护甲内置类似鞘翅的滑翔功能。默认配置中这些能力是关闭的。</p><p>- （3）级特殊戒指提供多种能力（如物品磁吸、范围采矿、植物/树木生长、物品修复、高跳、漂浮、夜视、负面效果免疫、末影箱访问、末影人瞬移能力、对怪物隐身，以及设置传送点的戒指）</p><p>- 注入Gobber能量的食物</p><p>- 右键点击可精准高速射箭的剑</p><p>- 右键放置火把的多功能工具</p><p>- 可调整步高（默认、1、2和3格高）的护符</p><p>- （3）级煤炭，燃烧时间分别为64,000、96,000和128,000</p><p>- 大量内容等待探索和发现</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/505/338/screen-shot-2022-10-09-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"665\" height=\"669\"></p><p><strong>1.20.6+版本变更</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>移除：<br>- 加速戒指<br>- 烈焰戒指<br>- 畜牧戒指<br>- 跳跃戒指<br>- 火焰戒指<br>- 海灵护符<br>- 海豚护符<br>- 发光护符<br>- 步高护符<br>- 丰收法杖<br>新增：<br>- 幸运戒指<br>- 力量戒指<br>- 痛苦护符（对附近怪物造成伤害）<br>- 海洋护符（结合海灵和海豚效果）<br>- 防护护符（抵御多种投射物）</p>\n</div><p><strong>1.19.2版本新增</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>可在玩家末影箱中使用的物品：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>经验护符</li>\n<li>呼吸护符</li>\n<li>海灵护符</li>\n<li>海豚护符</li>\n<li>治疗护符（小）</li>\n<li>治疗护符</li>\n<li>治疗护符（大）</li>\n<li>上升戒指 - 免疫跌落伤害</li>\n<li>凤凰戒指</li>\n<li>急速戒指</li>\n<li>净化戒指</li>\n<li>吸引戒指</li>\n<li>修复戒指</li>\n<li>迅捷戒指</li>\n<li>视觉戒指</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>为Gobber添加功能的其他模组</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>想要Gobber多功能斧：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-than-a-pickaxe\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Than a Pickaxe</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><strong>想要Gobber种子：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iap-gobber\" rel=\"nofollow\"> IAP (Gobber)</a></strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong><strong>1.18.1版本现已支持</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tetra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tetra</a><strong>模组和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/silent-gear\" rel=\"nofollow\">Silent's Gear</a>。</strong></strong><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong><strong>想要</strong></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gemcrabs-gobber\" rel=\"nofollow\">螃蟹</a>？</p>\n<p>Gobber食物扩展，适用于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber-delight-a-farmers-delight-add-on/files/3796583\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>通过进度系统追踪你的进展</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/389/77/screen-shot-2021-08-18-at-9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"644\" height=\"391\"></p><p><strong>采集等级说明：</strong></p><p>- <strong>Gobber矿石</strong>需要下界合金镐开采<br>- <strong>下界Gobber矿石</strong>需要Gobber镐开采<br>- <strong>末地Gobber矿石</strong>需要下界Gobber镐开采</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/316/974/screen-shot-2020-10-15-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"352\"></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/513/649/screen-shot-2022-11-07-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"590\" height=\"581\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/513/650/screen-shot-2022-11-07-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"590\" height=\"490\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/513/652/screen-shot-2022-11-07-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"590\" height=\"591\"><br></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/505/359/screen-shot-2022-10-09-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"808\" height=\"402\"></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/942/461/screenshot-2024-08-16-at-9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"677\" height=\"513\"></p><p><strong>护甲：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/287/507/screen-shot-2020-04-19-at-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"877\" height=\"450\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/287/537/screen-shot-2020-04-19-at-8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1044\" height=\"275\"></p><p><strong>额外工具：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/287/510/screen-shot-2020-04-19-at-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"571\" height=\"922\"></p><p><strong>包括：弓、整树斧、3x3锤、3x3挖掘铲和多功能工具</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/526/screen-shot-2020-03-13-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"875\" height=\"329\"></p><p>使用模组时如遇任何错误，请通过上方链接提交问题。</p><p>模组包制作者可自由在模组包中使用此模组。<br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/j7bYbkW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Gobber/BH_NU_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"142\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
